====== Linksys E1000 ======

{{section>meta:infobox:432_warning#infobox_for_dataentries&noheader&nofooter&noeditbutton}}

Linksys E1000 v1 is an 802.11n router. It has the same hardware as [[.:WRT160N|Linksys WRT160Nv3]] and [[..:cisco:M10|Cisco Valet M10 v1]].

